  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The critical angle and the refractive index of a media are related by the formula:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the value of the critical angle into equation (1) and solve to calculate the refractive index of the medium.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The refractive index of the medium can also be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (2) and solve to calculate the required speed of light within the medium.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
